		{
			"id":"9471ac77762d2a30",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Solution\n\n1. Orinda Aries\n2. Eraja\n3. Arch Aries\n4. Mora Jai\n5. Verra Shores\n6. Corarica\n7. Nuance\n8. Fenn Aries",
