		{
			"id":"6d0b2ca7787db900",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"There are two broken clocks in [[046 - Room 46.canvas|046 - Room 46]], these clocks are pointing to 01:30.\n\nWaiting until 01:30 does nothing.\n\nMaybe I need to wait until 03:00 because there are two clocks?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-800,
			"y":1420,
			"width":480,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"fccbe120f6806933",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Broken Clocks",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-350,
			"y":1260,
			"width":380,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"26e3e01a86afde44",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Blessing of Monk - Outer Room",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1080,
			"y":-1360,
			"width":620,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"1ba978e534ee2685",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The room is slightly different.\n\n- The copy of the deed is placed on the desk instead of the safe.\n- The Crown of the Blueprints is not on the desk.\n- Windows are blocked.\n- Everything else feels the same.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1080,
			"y":-1240,
			"width":640,
			"height":220
		},
